<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The above consolidated unaudited financial results for the quarter and half year ended 30th September 2019      n     were reviewed by the Audit Committee vide its meeting  held on November 12, 2019 and then approved by       n     the Board of Directors  at its meeting held on November 13, 2019. The Statutory auditors of the Company       n      have conducted a  Limited Review  of the above consolidated unaudited financialc  results.  nt t t t   n2. Effective April 1,2019, the company has adopted Ind AS 116  Leases   prospectively .The impact of Ind AS    n    116 on the profit and earnings for the period  ended September  30, 2019 was not material. t t t t t t   n3.  The consolidated financial results include the financial results of Indo National Limited and the financial results   n      of its subsidiary M/s. Helios Strategic Systems Limited  and step down subsidiaries M/s. Kineco limited , Kineco   n      Kaman Composites - India Private Limited and Kineco Alte Train Technologies Private Limited.  n  n4.   For the  half year  ended September  30, 2019, one of the step down subsidiary M/s.Kineco Ltd and its   n      subsidiaries has achieved the revenue of Rs.75.04 Crores, which amounts to more than 10% of the  total           n      consolidated revenue of  Rs.248.48 crores.  M/s.Kineco Ltd is in the business segment of Composites and       n      Aerospaces.  Considering the same,  IND AS 108,  segment reporting  becomes applicable for  consolidated  n       financial statements and accordingly details has been provided.  n  n5.  Figures of the earlier period, wherever necessary, have been regrouped / restated to confirm with those of      n      the current quarter.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
